#: f4a7d88beb364204bd150e945c9adca0
msgid ""
"Support for this board is available with ArduPilot-4.0 (and higher). Only "
"the V1 and V2 boards are supported. The V3 board changed microporcessor type"
" and is no longer capable of running ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"从 ArduPilot-4.0（及更高版本）开始支持此板。仅支持 V1 和 V2 板。V3 板更换了微处理器类型，不再能够运行 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:18
#: 1a41d313d845481e8bf3a407b2be5241
msgid ""
"Due to flash memory limitations, this board does not include all ArduPilot "
"features. See :ref:`Firmware Limitations <common-limited_firmware>` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"由于闪存限制，此板不包含所有 ArduPilot 功能。详情请参见 :ref:`固件限制 <common-limited_firmware>`。"

