#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:71
#: abc96b409eed42d08e231eeb02490489
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:73
#: 7100911eb8334452996d5d41a5ec8a4f
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R6 (UART6_RX) pin. It supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a "
"specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` is set to "
"\"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 R6（UART6_RX）引脚上。它支持除 PPM 外的所有 RC 协议。请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-systems` "
"了解特定 RC 系统的详情。:ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 默认设置为 「23」 以启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:75
#: ddd0cd0240b241dcb8d47985bd142ee5
msgid ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R6 pin but SBUS requires that the "
":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\"."
msgstr ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 R6 引脚，但 SBUS 要求将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"设置为 「3」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:77
#: 472993a22a4747d981b277349dff03a6
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T6 and :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要连接到 T6，并将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:79
#: 0ff13db293014342bf8e088ffda3940d
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T6 connection, in addition to R6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 除 R6 外还需要 T6 连接，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 "
"「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:81
#: 16b3f1059e494e64886f3baf4f9590ce
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to T6 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 T6 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:83
#: 0a5a611e4b414e4f846b822e94f8bae7
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:87
#: ea5287389648437dbc7f52e81893f32e
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:89
#: ab29a3dfa82d4ea086d51c36c343b368
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported using the T6 pin (UART6 transmit). You need to "
"set the following parameters to enable support for FrSky S.PORT."
msgstr "通过 T6 引脚（UART6 发送）支持 FrSky 数传。需要设置以下参数以启用对 FrSky S.PORT 的支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:92
#: 4d60cd5d06724bdcbe48166aa157ec53
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 4 or 10"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 4 或 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:93
#: 43cf3873b6474d1893de790b4b1344d1
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 7"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:95
#: 07cd2059de3746d58bf9457c778c0524
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported on all UARTs, UART6 TX is suggested as its RX "
"input is already being used for RC input and avoids consuming another UART."
msgstr "所有 UART 均支持 FrSky 数传，建议使用 UART6 TX，因为其 RX 输入已用于 RC 输入，可避免占用另一个 UART。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:99
#: 8b5fc78940a24afa856c48d188332f9c
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:101
#: ce7b7bef6d474f738ab26fc8ffe4acd3
msgid ""
"The KakuteF7 Mini supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver)."
msgstr "KakuteF7 Mini 支持使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:104
#: a000816774c44e4ab5121fe9919e807a
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:106
#: 6fcaa228db5244699594ff0bce352b9d
msgid ""
"TThe KakuteF7 Mini supports up to 6 outputs. M1 to M4 are accessed via the "
"connector and are :ref:`bi-directional<bidir-dshot>` capable. M5 and M6 are "
"the pads shown on the above diagram. M1-4 and M6 outputs support DShot as "
"well as all PWM types.M5 only supports PWM."
msgstr ""
"KakuteF7 Mini 最多支持 6 路输出。M1 至 M4 通过连接器访问，支持 :ref:`双向<bidir-dshot>` 功能。M5 和 "
"M6 为上图所示的焊盘。M1-4 和 M6 输出支持 DShot 及所有 PWM 类型，M5 仅支持 PWM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:108
#: f6ad478c37ef404d9764abd39f918252
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 3 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:110
#: e0f36194a90e4ec4a7d164d58294bd89
msgid "PWM 1, 4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:111
#: b092abe1bafe418ca1f67888597d5e68
msgid "PWM 2 and 3 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 2 和 3 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:112
#: bd29b6d56c894b5c9424ce325ddbf712
msgid "PWM 5 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5 在第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:113
#: 4c748368831e49c0a7e5b9f9f9a2eacd
msgid "PWM 6 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 6 在第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:115
#: b91b71ab171f43ccab4a422f8a60255c
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道需使用相同的输出频率。若某组内任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:118
#: fa90a051f5bb4d1095009eea3a1556f8
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:120
#: 560e01ee41bc418cbe495028efb06a95
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor. The voltage sensor can handle up to"
" 6S LiPo batteries. An external current sensor can be attached to pin 4 on "
"the ESC connector."
msgstr "该板内置电压传感器，最高可支持 6S 锂电池。外部电流传感器可连接到 ESC 连接器的第 4 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:124
#: ded60f4d25c641e78dbe142943657f51
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:126
#: 7f427feeca4449e99fc460140d13c3c5
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4, if external sensor used; 3 for voltage "
"only"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4（使用外部传感器时）；仅电压监测时设为 3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:127
#: c7f48077d34949038f05d04c520a4ae6
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 13"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:128
#: c8a88c40fd5340b9b15da9871ede338c
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 12 , if external "
"sensor used."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 12（使用外部传感器时）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:129
#: 7544ac60a86f49bcac2c8c7d7fac0b65
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10.9"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10.9"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:130
#: 17eef207f41646d98488fcdc27424215
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` should be set"
" to match external current sensor, if used."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"应根据所用外部电流传感器进行设置（若使用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:133
#: 252722a2d7b046a292204578d9cd038d
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:135
#: 20453f294dbd49e9a445cf372ade6e0f
msgid ""
"The KakuteF7 Mini does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "KakuteF7 Mini 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:138
#: 5ae5012b61a04585aea6799217e0c5a0
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:140
#: 7cf5cbecd34a433ab4c6ade53427fd7f
msgid "The KakuteF7 Mini supports on-board data flash logging."
msgstr "KakuteF7 Mini 支持板载数据闪存日志记录。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:143
#: 1337a1abaf884ca78bc6581e70f241c1
msgid "Loading ArduPilot onto the board"
msgstr "将 ArduPilot 加载到板上"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:145
#: 3a4111b66b2d4a15a3afca789963b102
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"初始固件加载可通过 DFU 完成：按住引导程序按钮并插入 USB。然后使用您常用的 DFU 加载工具加载 「with_bl.hex」 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:149
#: 4d9c691e1aa646e381ca3883950d4f96
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"xxxxxxxxxx.apj firmware files."
msgstr "加载初始固件后，可使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 xxxxxxxxxx.apj 固件文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:153
#: af530491d774483eaedcece6b1fa8d76
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:155
#: f11856a77be749d0ab793e729eed0638
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"KakuteF7Mini\"."
msgstr ""
"该板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 找到，位于标有 「KakuteF7Mini」 "
"的子文件夹中。"
